    "name":  "Flexible LED Neon 24V 13W/m - 50M Roll - Special for Signs - 6x12mm - Cut every 1cm - Red",
    "reference":  "92179",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eTransform your projects with this innovative \u003cstrong\u003eBacklit LED Neon\u003c/strong\u003e Flexible \u003cb\u003e24V DC - 13W/M\u003c/b\u003e, 50-meter reel (6x12mm, 120 diodes/m SMD2835), specially designed for \u003cstrong\u003esignage and customized decoration\u003c/strong\u003e. Unlike other products, its light is not direct, offering a soft and uniform effect ideal for customized signs. \u003cstrong\u003eCut every 1cm\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003edimmable\u003c/strong\u003e, provides maximum versatility to adapt to your creative needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade of \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-quality silicone\u003c/strong\u003e, guarantees \u003cstrong\u003eexceptional flexibility\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing creating figures or letters easily while preventing yellowing over time.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eFlexible LED Neon 24V 13W/m - 50M Roll - Special for Signs - 6x12mm - Cut every 1cm - Red\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlexible LED Neon 24V Red, 50m roll, 6x12mm. Cut every 1cm. Ideal for signage and lettering. IP65 outdoor (with silicone glue).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Outdoor signage, indoor decoration, architectural lighting, advertising.\u003c/h3\u003e",
